<item>
<title>Health</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14742</link>
<description>Found the health var by training, then put break on read.. So we could find the read that prints the health onscreen. Couldn't find anywhere that had a solid pointer, but found a reference to our health via s2, but this changed as it went through, but noticed that s1 was always pointing to the 1st character in the character array (our blokey), so jumped off to the patch area (0xc0000) and used pointer (s1) to restore health for only our bloke. Same method for armour.. Althoug this *was* only printed for our bloke, looks like enemies don't have armour.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
<category>cheats</category>
